# Avishkar Raceway on the other side: Max speed is about its controller's own speed (CR 702.178a, 702.179), which is
# tracked per player. Bot2 plays its own Avishkar Raceway on turn 2 with two Moxen and an Island on turn 4, and has
# speed 1 (CR 702.179a) while Bot1, with a Raceway of its own and three Lightning Bolts, reaches speed 4 on turn 5.
# Bot2 could pay {3}, tap the land and discard an Island, but its land does not have Bot1's max-speed ability.

